      "rationale": "Python lookup confirms seq[98]='S' and seq[99]='L', exactly matching the paper's stated junction (Ser99\u2013Leu100). Position 99 lies within ECL1 (topology 76\u2013116), 24 residues from the TM1 C-boundary (75) and 18 residues from the TM2 N-boundary (117), well clear of both TM walls. The same junction is independently corroborated by L2, L4, and L5, all from full-length, membrane-anchored constructs expressed in mammalian cells. Validation is scored surface_only because plasma membrane presence is directly demonstrated by immunofluorescence; functional transport activity of the tagged WT is not explicitly quantified in the cited papers. Full-length human ABCB4 with FLAG (DYKDDDDK) inserted between Ser99 and Leu100 in the first extracellular loop (ECL1, topology span 76\u2013116), expressed in mammalian cells; construct pcDNA3-ABCB4-FLAG and its mCherry-ABCB4-FLAG-WT derivative were used for high-content screening and immunofluorescence.",
